    "whatItDoes": "Vitals adds a bar widget showing one pinned metric (CPU, memory, network, disk, GPU or storage) and a dashboard popup with six live tiles, sparkline graphs and expandable details. When open it polls /proc, sensors, lspci and nvidia-smi/intel_gpu_top to populate per-core CPU, memory pressure, network/disk rates, GPU VRAM/temperature and a searchable, sortable process list with terminate/force-kill.",
